aronzobops","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10827_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T06:21:29-07:00","id":989844,"title":"","content":"Not even slightly was I was expecing them to be, but interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T12:37:32-07:00","id":990036,"title":"","content":"Have to say, this is more a conspiracy than a compact. Also, why do they call themselves the Workshop?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T13:01:19-07:00","id":990052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/989400-compact-the-workshop?p=990036#post990036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have to say, this is more a conspiracy than a compact. Also, why do they call themselves the Workshop?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks, Flyboy. Good point and good question. I'll try to answer as best I can, a lot of the groundwork does need to be reevaluated beyond the 'flavor' of the text so it holds up.<br /> <br /> <b>1. </b>I'll snag a little clip from the White Wolf Wiki regarding Compacts.&quot;<i>Their scale and operations and geographical reach can range from local neighbourhoods to whole cities, with the biggest compacts <b>covering entire regions</b>.&quot; </i>Though the Endowment is more common with Conspiracies we wanted to emphasis that the Workshop has spent its existence in and around the London area. Some of its chapters do go out as far as Glasglow and Workshop Hunters, on occasion, do travel but (and this is something we can add in) its always for a specific reason that is relevent to the homefront. So Compact seemed the logical choice for the size of their operation.<br /> <br /> <b>2. </b>Besides being a nod to the Healing Church Workshop from Bloodborne, the name fits the general attitude of how they approach their Vigil. It's a trade and you should always be improving on your trade. The Workshop is dedicated to the traditions of their forebears and that's one of the things they wanted to impart to the generations to come, striving to be the deadliest Hunters they could be. More detail will definitely be written up about the origin of the name though, it's a solid question.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10827,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10827-baronzobops","user":"baronzobops","date":". 10-19-2016, 05:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10827-baronzobops","name":"baronzobops","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10827_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}